  "solution": {
    "text": "Let mass of solution be 100 g<br/><br/>Volume of solution  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1.04</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>96.154</mn><mtext> mL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.096</mn><mtext> L</mtext></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mtext> g</mtext></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>58.5</mn><mtext> g mo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>     (molar mass of NaCl)<br/><br/>For complete ionisation of NaCl, van't Hoff factor will be '2'.<br/><br/>i = 2<br/><br/>we know,<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.0821</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>293</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>58.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.096</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>29.98</mn><mtext> atm</mtext></math>",
